### Search & tags
### Routes: GET /api/search, GET /api/tags
###
### Search is a case-insensitive full-text match over document titles and excludes
### documents in /trash. The query parameter is `q`.

### Search — empty query (returns all matchable documents)
GET {{apiUrl}}/search

### Search — basic query
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=getting started

### Search — single word
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=markdown

### Search — multiple words
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=wiki documents

### Search — quoted phrase
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q="getting started"

### Search — URL-encoded spaces
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=getting%20started%20guide
# => 200 { "query": "...", "documents": [...], "total": n }

### All tags with usage counts
# @name tags
GET {{apiUrl}}/tags
# => 200 { "tags": [ { "name": "...", "count": n } ], "total": n }
